  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An Accountable Grant with the International Forestry Resources and Institutions (IFRI) to deliver a method measuring the number of for the forest dependent people helped by the International Climate Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity An Accountable Grant with the International Forestry Resources and Institutions (IFRI) to deliver a method measuring the number of for the forest dependent people helped by the International Climate Fund is a component of Monitoring , Evaluation and Learning from  the International Climate Fund   reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,890,712. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Forestry research, Forestry policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
